{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">啟德智慧綠色集體運輸系統中午截標。包括港鐵在內等財團代表，陸續到政總東翼投遞標書。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KAITAK-1200.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026oLA6S7IXQp1786682223.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.KAITAK-1200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">工程是在啟德建造全長約3.5公里的智慧綠色集體運輸系統，包括一條高架專屬車道走廊、六個車站及一個高架車廠，為區內提供輕便和綠色的交通接駁服務至就近的鐵路站，強化區內商住發展和社區設施等的連貫性，以及與現行鐵路網絡的連繫。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KAITAK-1200_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026O3DpQNp55n1786682227.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.KAITAK-1200_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T04:59:44.433187+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}